 prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025, November to December finished at 62% of normal on the middle of the grids, and so far in 2026 March to April sits at 64%. Grid 19984 had its driest year in 2007 at 67% of normal.</p>"}
